(100, 'Baku', '76', '76', 'Day Trip', NULL, NULL, NULL, '09:00 – Leaving Baku to Lahij (1 way x 3.5 hrs)  Scenic drive through the mountains, passing traditional villages and lush landscapes.    12:30 – Arrive at Lahij    Lahij Village – Explore the historic mountain village known for its cobbled streets, traditional copper craftsmanship, and preserved Caucasian architecture.  Local Workshops – Watch artisans creating copperware, handicrafts, and souvenirs.  Panoramic Views – Enjoy the surrounding mountains and scenic vistas.  13:00 –Lunch Break    14:00 – Continue Lahij Tour  Guests can stroll through the village, shop for local handicrafts, and take photos of the picturesque scenery.    15:30 – Leaving Lahij to Baku  18:00 – Dinner Break (if included)  19:00 – Arrive at Baku Hotel  Overnight in Baku', NULL, NULL, 'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)', 76.00, '2026-02-21 12:16:25'),
