(15, 'Baku', 'Ismayilli', 'Day Trip', NULL, NULL, NULL, '09:00 – Depart from Hotel to Ismayilli (1 way takes 3.5 hour)\n\n 12:30 - Lunch Break \n\n13:30 - The journey begins with a scenic drive from Baku to Ismayilli, passing mountains, small villages, and natural landscapes.\n - Shamakhi Juma Mosque\n Visit one of the oldest mosques in the country, originally dating back to the 8th century and beautifully restored while preserving its historic identity.\n \n - Yeddi Gumbaz Mausoleum (Photo Stop)\n A historical mausoleum complex offering panoramic views and a short stop for photos.\n \n17:00 – Leave Ismayilli to Baku\n \n20:30 – Dinner Break (if included)\n \n21:30 – Drop to the Hotel\n \nOvernight in Baku', 71.00, 76.00, 80.00, 85.00, 206.00, 295.00, 354.00, 412.00, 412.00, 20.00, 47.00),
