(33, 'Baku', 'Gakh', 'Day Trip', NULL, NULL, NULL, '08:00 – Leaving Baku to Gakh (1 way x 5 hrs)\n \n13:00 – Lunch Break\n \n14:00 – Visit Ilisu Village\n - Ilisu is a historic mountain village known for its stone houses, fresh air, waterfalls, and panoramic views. The village reflects preserved Caucasian architecture and traditional lifestyle.\n \n15:00 – Visit Ulu Mosque (Ilisu Mosque)\n - Dating back to the 16th century, this mosque is an important cultural and religious landmark of the region and one of the oldest preserved Islamic structures in Gakh.\n \n16:00 – Visit Sumug Gala (Defensive Tower)\n - A medieval defensive tower once used to guard Ilisu and monitor strategic mountain routes. Today it stands as a symbol of local heritage and offers scenic photo points.\n \n16:30 – Leaving Gakh to Baku\n \n21:00 – Dinner Break (if included)\n \n22:00 – Drop to the Hotel\n \nOvernight in Baku', 77.00, 83.00, 101.00, 112.00, 295.00, 383.00, 442.00, 500.00, 500.00, 20.00, 47.00),
