(130, 'Airport', 'Hotel + Panaromic City Tour', 'Private Transfer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pick-up from GYD Airport based on flight time. \n\n 15:00 Check-in at the Hotel \n\n 17:00 Evening City Tour starts with panoramic full evening city view of Baku followed by:\n - Highland Park -Which is the highest point in the Azerbaijani capital, opening a panoramic view of the city and its bay. The city\'s residents and visitors often come here to see a bird\'s eye view of Baku, and just have a walk. The Upland Park can be reached by cable railway (funicular) in 7-8 minutes from the boulevard or by climbing up the endless stone stairs.\n - Flame Towers -The city\'s tallest building. The height of 182 m. Flame Towers - consisting of three high-rise buildings in the complex.\n\n 18:00 Dinner Break (if included)\n\n 19:00 Drop to the Hotel\n\n Overnight in Baku', 30.00, 30.00, 36.00, 48.00, 124.00, 147.00, 177.00, 206.00, 206.00, 20.00, 47.00),
(131, 'Airport', 'Hotel + Panaromic City Tour + Boulevard Tour', 'Private Transfer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pick-up from GYD Airport based on flight time. \n \n15:00 Check-in at the Hotel \n\n 17:00 Evening City Tour starts with panoramic full evening city view of Baku followed by:\n - Highland Park -Which is the highest point in the Azerbaijani capital, opening a panoramic view of the city and its bay. The city\'s residents and visitors often come here to see a bird\'s eye view of Baku, and just have a walk. The Upland Park can be reached by cable railway (funicular) in 7-8 minutes from the boulevard or by climbing up the endless stone stairs.\n - Flame Towers -The city\'s tallest building. The height of 182 m. Flame Towers - consisting of three high-rise buildings in the complex.\n \n 18:00 Boulevard Tour starts with walking along Baku Boulevard, including:\n - Carpet Museum\n - Mini Venice of Baku\n - Deniz Mall\n - Ferris Wheel\n - Crystal Hall\n\n 19:00 – Dinner Break (if included)\n\n 20:00 – Drop to the Hotel\n\n Overnight in Baku', 30.00, 30.00, 36.00, 48.00, 124.00, 147.00, 177.00, 206.00, 206.00, 20.00, 47.00),
